ad>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_barrel_dad.\" title=\"The barrel dad.\">The barrel dad.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.\" title=\"Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut.\">Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Stay humble.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 5 June 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\">Iain Stirling</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stay_humble.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Stay humble\" was <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\">Joe Thomas</a>' advice for people handling birthday candles, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_realistic_injury_using_food\" title=\"Make the most realistic injury using food\">Make the most realistic injury using food</a> task. Beans were often used by contestants for the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_realistic_injury_using_food\" title=\"Make the most realistic injury using food\">Make the most realistic injury using food</a> task, hence the beans in the title card.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stay_humble.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Forbliv ydmyg', which translates as 'Stay humble'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pysykää nöyränä', which translates as 'Stay humble'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stay_humble.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Iain Stirling</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Thomas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lou Sanders</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Sinha</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sian Gibson</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_face\" title=\"Best face\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best face.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Divert_the_sand_from_bucket_A_into_bucket_B\" title=\"Divert the sand from bucket A into bucket B\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Divert the sand from bucket A into bucket B. You may not touch the sand. You may not move the buckets. You may not leave the room.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_realistic_injury_using_food\" title=\"Make the most realistic injury using food\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most realistic injury using food. If two or more people use tomato ketchup, they are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Have_a_long-distance_game_of_catch_with_this_beach_ball\" title=\"Have a long-distance game of catch with this beach ball\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Have a long-distance game of catch with this beach ball. One team member must be filmed in one location throwing the ball out of shot. Another team member must then be filmed in another location, catching the ball correctly and throwing the ball out of shot and so on.\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Most distance covered on their own.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Herd_the_most_ping-pong_balls_into_the_ping-pong_pen\" title=\"Herd the most ping-pong balls into the ping-pong pen\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Herd the most ping-pong balls into the ping-pong pen. You may only touch the ping-pong balls with the basketball, the string or one little finger. You may not move the ping-pong pens.. <br /><small><i><b>Secret Instruction</b>: Herd this ball and you halve your total.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Recreate_the_scene_in_the_box\" title=\"Recreate the scene in the box\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Recreate the scene in the box. You will parade past it once, and must be touching the person in front of you throughout the parade.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stay_humble.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative s